# @imqueue

> {{ site.definition }} No hand-written client code, no service discovery, no load balancer.

@imqueue is an open-source framework (GPL-3.0). Core packages: @imqueue/core (reliable message queue over Redis), @imqueue/rpc (typed RPC with automatic client generation), @imqueue/cli (scaffolding and orchestration of services). Commercial licensing and support for closed-source products: https://imqueue.com

{%- comment -%}
Everything an agent needs to know about HOW to read this site belongs here, in
the free-prose block between the blockquote and the first H2 — which is the only
place the llms.txt convention puts prose. It used to live inside `## Reference`
(eight lines) and `## Articles` (two), and a consumer that splits this file on H2
boundaries and parses each section as a link list gets those paragraphs as
malformed list items, or drops the section. Same reason the per-group reference
headings below are `##` and not `###`: an H2 splitter folds H3 content into
whichever H2 preceded it, so every capability package was being attributed to the
framework-spine section. The @imqueue MCP server is one such consumer — its
`^##\s+` never matched `### `, so every capability package it indexed carried
`section: "Reference"`.

The `%}` closing this block deliberately does NOT strip trailing whitespace: it
has to leave the blank line that separates this paragraph from the one above,
or llms.txt ships `…https://imqueue.comConventions for machine readers`.
{%- endcomment %}

Conventions for machine readers. Every page listed below is also published as
plain markdown at BOTH `<page-url>index.md` and `<page>.md` — byte-identical, same
content, no HTML, no navigation. (`/intro/index.md` and `/intro.md` are the same
file; the ecosystem is split on which shape it should be, so this site serves both.)
Under `/api/` that holds for every per-symbol page too, but only for the current
major: archived majors are HTML-only. To look a symbol up by name instead of
browsing, fetch {{ siteUrl }}/api/search-index.json — every exported symbol of
the current majors as `{name, kind, package, url, summary}`, with
`deprecated: true` on obsolete members. Start from a package index to see every
exported symbol with its summary, then follow the symbol link for the signature,
parameters, return value, exceptions and remarks.
{%- comment -%}
The literal contact address, in the intro block rather than inside an H2 —
sections here hold link lists only.

Cloudflare's Email Obfuscation strips this address from 100% of the HTML on both
zones (the full measurement is in src/_shared/_includes/head.html), so a crawler
that does not run JavaScript cannot find any way to contact the project. This
file is served as text/plain, which obfuscation does not rewrite, so the address
survives here. Same reasoning put it in the Organization JSON-LD.
{%- endcomment %}

Contact: support@imqueue.com reaches the maintainers — framework questions,
documentation problems, security reports and commercial licensing enquiries.
